		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]ひめ『よーし
ぜったいに　かたないと……！▽
だいじなのは……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
